    "idiom": "100% stacked bars"
  },
  "description": "About 60% of poultry businesses report annual turnover of at least AUD 200,000. Left: annual sales under 200,000 Australian dollars. Right: 200,000 or more. Rows rank the right-side share. Sales are not profit. Labels show poultry and deer, or your selected sector. Three bands combine six published bins; percentages use their sum because confidentiality adjustments affect totals."
